    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__CreditNote__c records with a remaining unallocated balance.
Why it matters: Credit notes that aren&apos;t applied to invoices misrepresent customer AR balances — finance shows artificially high outstanding receivables. Customers also dispute when they paid against a credit that &quot;disappeared&quot;.
Suppress a finding: for credit notes intentionally held open pending future invoice allocation.
Disable the detector: only if your billing process doesn&apos;t use credit notes. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
